  "content": "\n\n<center>\n\n![Pattern Texture Pack header](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/2F04lb0o/images/9e134315a5502f8fb2588d33ae2248c4569c5c50.jpeg)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">Набор текстур Pattern</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pattern-texture-pack\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pattern\">\n  <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"github\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"спонсоры GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"ko-fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\nУкрасьте свой мир этим ярким и красочным набором текстур, наполненным красивыми узорами и вязаными животными!\n<p></p>\n\nЭтот набор добавляет тематические текстуры для блоков, предметов, существ и пользовательского интерфейса.\n<p></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Предпросмотр</summary>\n\n![river](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/2F04lb0o/images/b648b0b36dd6754f0350736453313e2573e596c4.jpeg)\n\n![animals](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/2F04lb0o/images/fba73959e2c4f133b302f2e46129388e52ee7f8c.jpeg)\n\n![villagers](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/2F04lb0o/images/fba9515c93bc3b9aea958e760a65e7527960be80.jpeg)\n\n![caver